WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.900
Step 1. In TripCache, open Profile → AI agents and copy your TripCache link.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.550
Step 2. In ChatGPT: Plugins → Add → Add custom MCP server. Paste the link, keep OAuth, and tap Create.

3
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:14.300
Step 3. On the TripCache page, choose Approve with the TripCache app and enter your email.

4
00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:21.100
Step 4. On your phone, tap the number shown in your browser, then confirm with Face ID.

5
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:35.400
Step 5. Ask about your trips: “When’s my next flight?” or “Add a Hertz car to my Melbourne trip”.

6
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:39.000
Your trips, in ChatGPT. Connect your AI agent with TripCache Pro.
